    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri sets the scene and asks your child what they notice. No right answer yet — just looking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.1.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "يعدّ بيري المشهد ويسأل طفلك ما هو ما يلاحظه. لا يوجد إجابة صحيحة بعد - فقط ننظر.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.1.desc-2026-07-07T20:32:46.562814+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-07T20:32:46.562814+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T20:32:46.562814+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child records what they see, hear, or measure. Peri prompts for specifics if the answer is vague."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.2.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "\"يرسخ الطفل ما يراه أو يسمع أو يقاس. يطلب بيري التفاصيل إذا كان الجواب غامضًا.\"\n\n(Translation: \"The child records what he sees or hears or measures. Peri asks for details if the answer is vague.\")",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-07T20:32:46.562814+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks comparison and classification questions. What\\'s similar? What\\'s different? What pattern do you see?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.3.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "تسأل بيري أسئلة عن المقارنة والتصنيف. ما هو Similar؟ ما هو مختلف؟ أي نمط تراه؟",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child proposes a cause or mechanism. Peri tests it with evidence questions, not hints."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.4.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "يقدم طفلك سببًا أو ميكانيكيةً. يفتتح بيري اختبارها باستخدام أسئلة الأدلة، وليس الإشارات.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-07T20:33:09.629325+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
