      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "\"أولمّا = محلي، tứcٍ، تكلفة صفر. هايكو tứcٍ = سحابي، tứcٍ، ~ $0.001/نداء. هايكو دفعة = سحابي، الليل، 50% أرخص — تقييم التقديم فقط.\"\n\nTranslation notes:\n- \"Ollama\" and \"Haiku\" are kept as they are, as they seem to be product/service names.\n- \"local\", \"instant\", \"zero cost\", \"cloud\", \"overnight\", \"cheaper\" are translated using standard Arabic terms for these concepts.\n- The symbols \"$\" and \"/\" are preserved as they are.",
